## Pin and fork disposition

The selected unmodified graph is:

| Component | Revision | License |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `hev-socks5-tunnel` | `ad7600497931205105b08367bd1b450048157e40` | MIT |
| `hev-socks5-core` | `c234519072ff5b928b90b304da9a666bcb440455` | MIT |
